Based strictly on the provided files for the `op-blockchain` crate, there are no D-Bus interface mappings (e.g., `#[dbus_interface]` attributes from `zbus`) declared directly inside this module. Although the crate imports types that interact with D-Bus client pipelines elsewhere, the BTRFS subvolume and snapshotting mechanisms do not expose system-bus peers directly in this codebase.

