* **Details:** Define `Plugin`, `Schema`, and `PluginCatalogDocument` structures within a `.proto` schema (e.g., `op/dbus/v1/model.proto`). Use `prost` or `tonic` to generate Rust structures instead of defining ad-hoc structs.
