| `JsonRpcResponse` | Rust Struct | `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/protocol.rs:36` | No | Expressed as an ad-hoc Rust struct. Uses untyped `simd_json::OwnedValue` for `result` and `id`, making response payloads schema-less. |
