#### Command Executions (`Command::new`)
A total of four (4) `Command::new` (or `tokio::process::Command::new`) invocation sites were identified:

1.  **`crates/op-llm/src/gcloud_adc.rs:69`**
    ```rust
    let output = Command::new("gcloud")
