## II. First 5 `.unwrap()` Sites

### 1. `crates/op-state-store/src/event_chain.rs:313`
```rust
            first_event_id: events.first().unwrap().event_id,
```

### 2. `crates/op-state-store/src/event_chain.rs:314`
