//!
//! The agent will be registered as:
//! - Service name: `org.dbusmcp.Agent.{AgentType}` (e.g., `org.dbusmcp.Agent.PythonPro`)
//! - Object path: `/org/dbusmcp/Agent/{AgentType}`
//! - Interface: `org.dbusmcp.Agent`
